   "text": "the same views as Report: ⚙️ Process when it has a step, then 📊 Results by the same code; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; no view starts with a Waits-on-you section; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Timeline · Skills · Files, as served 261106",
